  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned}\n& 0.8=\\frac{5.1 \\times 1000 \\times 1}{51 \\times \\mathrm{M}_{\\mathrm{PQ}_2}} \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{M}_{\\mathrm{PQ}_2}=125 \\\\\n& 0.625=\\frac{5.1 \\times 1000 \\times 1}{51 \\times \\mathrm{M}_{\\mathrm{PQ}_3}} \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{M}_{\\mathrm{PQ}_3}=160\n\\end{aligned}$\n$\\therefore$ At wt of $P=55$ and $Q=35$",
